# Who may sign an AerieOS release (R199): ssh-keygen's allowed signers
# format, one line a key:
#   builderbot-release namespaces="builderbot-release" ssh-ed25519 AAAA... COMMENT
# Every update an install takes (the controller's bundle, AerieOS's
# image, a stick's image) must carry a SHA256SUMS signed by a key here, as
# the install holds this file, so someone who changes the repository or a
# release cannot hand installs a build: they can build and attest one, not
# sign it. The private half never touches the repository, CI or a controller:
# its holder signs each release on their own machine (tools/release-sign.py).
# With no key here yet, nothing is signed and updates say so.
